---
import DocsLayout from "../../layouts/DocsLayout.astro";
import Code from "../../components/docs/Code.astro";
import Endpoint from "../../components/docs/Endpoint.astro";
---

<DocsLayout title="Logs and analytics" lead="Every call leaves a full record you can query: its event timeline and transcript, plus totals across all your calls and the seconds you've used." slug="logs">
        <h2 id="timeline">One call</h2>
        <p>The event timeline and transcript for a single call are covered under <a href="/docs/calls/#events">Calls</a>:</p>
        <Endpoint method="GET" path="/v1/calls/{id}/events" />
        <Endpoint method="GET" path="/v1/calls/{id}/transcript" />

        <h2 id="stats">Stats</h2>
        <Endpoint method="GET" path="/v1/stats" />
        <p>Totals across your calls. By default this covers the current calendar month; pass <code>since</code> and <code>until</code> (ISO 8601) for another range.</p>
        <Code tabs={[{ label: "cURL", lang: "bash", code: `curl http://localhost:8000/v1/stats \\
  -H "Authorization: Bearer $OFFHOOK_KEY"` }, { label: "Response", lang: "json", code: `{
  "total_calls": 1284,
  "by_status": { "completed": 1180, "failed": 104 },
  "by_error_code": { "no_answer": 71, "busy": 22, "carrier_error": 11 },
  "failure_rate": 0.081,
  "total_seconds": 41230,
  "avg_seconds": 34.9
}` }]} />

        <h2 id="usage">Usage</h2>
        <Endpoint method="GET" path="/v1/usage" />
        <p>
          Billable seconds and number of calls. By default this covers the current calendar
          month; pass <code>from</code> and <code>to</code> (ISO 8601) for another range.
        </p>
        <Code tabs={[{ label: "Response", lang: "json", code: `{ "total_seconds": 41230, "call_count": 1180 }` }]} />

        <h2 id="dashboard">In the dashboard</h2>
        <p>
          If you run the optional dashboard, it shows the same information without any
          code: a call list, each call's timeline and transcript, and charts. See
          <a href="/docs/self-hosting/#components">Self-hosting</a>.
        </p>

</DocsLayout>
